      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create select_platform_resource.py in the current working directory.\nTask: resolves a provider-specific model, deployment, or inference resource before invocation.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
